            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "POST/PUT user and role endpoints validate that referenced roles exist and permission strings are well-formed, but never compare granted roleIds/permissions/scope against the caller's own authority. A subject with user:write and role:write but no admin permission can create a role with *:* and assign it to any user; governance decisions then treat that user as fully privileged."
          },
